# ============================================================
# .gitignore — hardened for financial material
#
# This repo holds personal financial data. The failure mode is a real
# statement or export committed by accident and living in git history
# forever. data/ is gitignored ENTIRELY per docs/DESIGN.md: it lives
# only on disk and in the porter backup, never in Git.
# ============================================================

# --- Real financial data: never committed, per DESIGN.md ---
/data/
/reports/

# --- Credentials and environment ---
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
credentials*
secrets*

# --- Statement / export formats, wherever they land ---
# tests/fixtures/ holds SANITIZED samples only and is re-included below.
*.csv
*.ofx
*.qfx
*.qif
*.xls
*.xlsx
*.pdf

# --- Local databases ---
*.duckdb
*.duckdb.wal
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db

# --- Python / tooling artefacts ---
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
*.egg-info/
dist/
build/

# --- OS and editor noise ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# --- Explicit re-inclusions ---
# gitignore is last-match-wins, so these MUST stay at the bottom.
# Only sanitized fixture data may be re-included here.
!/tests/fixtures/
!/tests/fixtures/**
